<title>UK: SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH AND CHESTERFIELD DRAW 3-3 IN F.A. CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH AND CHESTERFIELD DRAW 3-3 IN F.A. CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Middlesbrough and Chesterfield</p>
<p>drew 3-3 after extra time in their English F.A. Cup semifinal</p>
<p>match at Old Trafford on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Chesterfield - Andy Morris 54, Sean Dyche 60 pen, Jamie</p>
<p>Hewitt 119.</p>
<p>Middlesbrough - Fabrizio Ravanelli 64, Craig Hignett 70 pen,</p>
<p>Gianluca Festa 100.</p>
<p>Attendance: 49,640.</p>
</text>
